  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sangwari: Moving towards a child marriage free society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work to reduce the incidence of child marriage in the project area - Surguja, Chattisgarh, with the overall goal to make sure girls marry at the legal age by their choice</narrative>
  </description>
